{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":27.600000381469727,"text":"On the slope below the Acropolis, there was a small sanctuary of Nymphae, the goddess of weddings. Athenian women left lutefori there, tall, narrow vases with two handles that carried the water for the bath before a wedding. Painted on them is the procession itself, the bride, her friends, the torches. Archaeologists found thousands of fragments gathered in one pit, as if the whole sanctuary had been tidied out on a single day.","words":[{"word":"On","start":0,"end":0.46000000834465027},{"word":"the","start":0.46000000834465027,"end":0.7400000095367432},{"word":"slope","start":0.7400000095367432,"end":0.9200000166893005},{"word":"below","start":0.9200000166893005,"end":1.2000000476837158},{"word":"the","start":1.2000000476837158,"end":1.5199999809265137},{"word":"Acropolis","start":1.5199999809265137,"end":1.7799999713897705},{"word":"there","start":2.2200000286102295,"end":2.2799999713897705},{"word":"was","start":2.2799999713897705,"end":2.440000057220459},{"word":"a","start":2.440000057220459,"end":2.640000104904175},{"word":"small","start":2.640000104904175,"end":3.0199999809265137},{"word":"sanctuary","start":3.0199999809265137,"end":3.4000000953674316},{"word":"of","start":3.4000000953674316,"end":3.9200000762939453},{"word":"Nymphae","start":3.9200000762939453,"end":4.179999828338623},{"word":"the","start":4.480000019073486,"end":4.760000228881836},{"word":"goddess","start":4.760000228881836,"end":4.860000133514404},{"word":"of","start":4.860000133514404,"end":5.480000019073486},{"word":"weddings","start":5.480000019073486,"end":5.480000019073486},{"word":"Athenian","start":6.380000114440918,"end":6.579999923706055},{"word":"women","start":6.579999923706055,"end":6.860000133514404},{"word":"left","start":6.860000133514404,"end":7.260000228881836},{"word":"lutefori","start":7.260000228881836,"end":7.960000038146973},{"word":"there","start":7.960000038146973,"end":8.300000190734863}